{
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "arrival_miss",
      "speaker": "eleanor",
      "text": "You're not where I meant to put you.",
      "gate": {
        "type": "tap"
      },
      "allow": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "arrival_place",
      "speaker": "eleanor",
      "text": "This is Emberkeep. I aimed for the hall — the spell was clean, I've cast it a hundred times. Something set you down here instead.",
      "gate": {
        "type": "tap"
      },
      "allow": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "arrival_ash",
      "speaker": "eleanor",
      "text": "Mind your footing. That grey isn't soil. Fires die slowly, from the edges in — this one went out all at once, everywhere, in a single night.",
      "gate": {
        "type": "tap"
      },
      "allow": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "arrival_slip",
      "speaker": "eleanor",
      "text": "You'll want to know what did that. So did I, once. I read every account there is. I crossed half the world for the rest. I was—",
      "gate": {
        "type": "tap"
      },
      "allow": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "arrival_hold",
      "speaker": "eleanor",
      "text": "…Later. You'll hear it better when you're not standing in it.",
      "gate": {
        "type": "tap"
      },
      "allow": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "arrival_why",
      "speaker": "eleanor",
      "text": "And why you: when you landed, the ash under your hands went warm. It hasn't done that for anyone in sixty years. I watched it happen and I still don't believe it.",
      "gate": {
        "type": "tap"
      },
      "allow": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "arrival_ask",
      "speaker": "eleanor",
      "text": "So I'll ask instead of explaining. Bring this place back — the warmth, the green, and whatever's still asleep beneath the ash. I can't wake any of it. You can, Keeper.",
      "gate": {
        "type": "tap"
      },
      "allow": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "ash_green",
      "speaker": "eleanor",
      "text": "…Look down. The grey is going green where your hands were. Ash Moss — the isle's first answer. Three tufts make a bundle; drag them together.",
      "gate": {
        "type": "event",
        "event": "item:merged",
        "chain": "ashmoss"
      },
      "effects": [
        {
          "spawn": {
            "chain": "ashmoss",
            "tier": 1,
            "count": 3,
            "at": [
              7,
              5
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "highlight": [
        {
          "chain": "ashmoss",
          "nth": 0,
          "tier": 1
        },
        {
          "chain": "ashmoss",
          "nth": 1,
          "tier": 1
        },
        {
